  theta_HI arcsec                        47: 40.200 [26.469-55.185]   23 pairs: 56.001 [47.996-93.755]   15 code-1: 66.262 [55.227-101.093]
  MIGHTEE neighbours in 3.5' x 400 km/s  47: 0.000 [0.000-1.000]   23 pairs: 0.000 [0.000-1.000]   15 code-1: 0.000 [0.000-1.000]
